**Shadow Cant**, also known as **Loavada** (/' *loava:da:* /, [[shadow-cant|Shadow Cant]]: *ꖃꕉꕙꕜ*  ) is the secret [[history-and-overview-of-the-languages-of-iagoband|language]] of [[pyrah|Py'rah]]'s followers.

